        <p>New Wilmer for St. Ann's School. Ur. W. Richardson, Bully Bank, Walton, has 'been appointed a manager for St, An' s School.</p>
        <p>Scarlet Fever) Cases.</p>
        <p>With GO scarlet fever cases in hospital, the epidemic seems to be on the increase. Niue new cases were reported last week.</p>
