        <p>Market Fires. A couple of mysterious fires have occurred in the Market during the past fortnight, involving wooden lock-up stalls. In each case the flames were at the fi quickly got under, especially re last Monday, when the brigade were soon on the spot. The cause of the fires is unknown.</p>
        <p>The Church Army: Warrington Cadet. Amongst the cadets who come into residence at the Church Army's London Headquarters' Training Home to-day (Saturday) to qualify for the career they have chosen as agents of the varied home mission work of the Church Army is a Warrington printer's assistant.</p>
        <p>• Teachers' Salaries Increased. long list of advances in the salaries of teachers was submitted to the Warrington Edu- cation Committee on Monday and approved. Alderman Bennett said the members were get- !,ing alarmed at the increases, but it was stated e advances were in accordance with the Com- nlittee's scale.</p>
