        <p>Feeding an Army bY Automobile 'Bus. At the Army manwuvres this year the French Government determined to supply its soldiers with fresh meat instead of the canned that had hitherto been their ration. In order to do this d in the nd them a sst adbell iisvlei erdY w 35 a grog 1111 Depots rear; there the beasts were slaughtere eBs. they impressed many of the Paris rootor-omni- a busese of live an neda ut tsleed were h established the carcasses were hung on hooks in the roofs of the omnibuses, the wirfaows of which had been replaced with wire galize- Each (lay before noon the 'buses started on their rounds to the regiments and by sunset the regimental of company cooks were roasting or boiling ttki evening meal.</p>
