        <p>Produce 40 New Men.</p>
        <p>RscarrlTlNG CRUSADE.</p>
        <p>South Lancashire's Route Marches</p>
        <p>A recruiting crusade has been carried through by the officers and men of the South Lancashire Itcgiment stationed at Warrington, and it has proved very successful, no less than 40 applica- tions having been made and numerous promises received.</p>
